scenario.en:
CREATE INDEX idx_users_lower_email ON users (LOWER(email));

-- Query A (used at signup-uniqueness check):
SELECT id FROM users WHERE LOWER(email) = 'alice@x.com';

-- Query B (used at login):
SELECT id FROM users WHERE email = 'alice@x.com';

Which query (A, B, both, neither) can use idx_users_lower_email?

